{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块超大号高亮白字标题：“明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近，他却还是忍不住想：万一能呢？”\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人想回去找回曾经的亲近，但明知未必能如愿，仍忍不住抱有期待。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"眷恋、期待、犹疑，带着不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"下方第二块大字补充的具体处境：决定先把眼下日子过稳，仍然害怕以后独自承担、心里没底，但不愿因此收回打算。右上角阶段目录和两处小字说明也不容易第一眼获取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块字号和亮度都很突出的文字争夺主视线。\",\n    \"下方大段文字包含当前打算、未来担忧和不愿退缩等多层意思，需要额外阅读才能完整获取。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c5b26bd8-1eb8-42ac-aad5-ab0f633d1765", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013130763310Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:32:07.499544+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cd53294e0de465b8daee9d47d63c83485adfd85b894477a473cdc5b6308aa4d6", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":